From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: malfrador <malfrador@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 07:20:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional Anti-Xray palette compaction POC metrics

Add action bar timings and a palettecompaction on/off/status/reset command
on top of the palette compaction implementation. OFF retains normal mode-1
Anti-Xray and skips only the rewrite.

Capture each packet mode for consistent A/B attribution, accumulate
nanosecond timings outside the measured operation, and report compaction
separately from queue-inclusive packet-ready latency. Raw byte savings
are measured before network compression.

This patch is optional proof-of-concept instrumentation and can be dropped
without removing the palette compaction implementation.

